model l3_never
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.3 (#247), the plan's §8.4: book/ledger.rs ledger_model on a hole-day instance (MUTANTS-SURVIVORS, the guard exists set to true). pw's day is a window row across March's end, a hole day in 2.3, and it never exists (live false from the start), yet an observation dated 2026-03-30 names it: the ledger holds no model line for pw"

source s "s"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input amt: money PLN
input w: date
input live: bool
input bank: observed

move pw: transfers
  on w
  when live
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  live = false "s"
  w = window(2026-03-25, 2026-04-05) "s"

version st
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-10
  covers konto
  pad konto from unexplained
  stated[konto] = 600.00 PLN at 2026-03-31 end "s"
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-03-30, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 100.00 PLN, fulfils: pw) "r1"

ask r_both: residuals konto 2026-03 .. 2026-04
ask r_mar: residuals konto 2026-03
ask b_mar: bal(konto, 2026-03-31)
ask r_p25: residuals konto 2026-03 .. 2026-04 with w = 2026-03-25
